{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：03:38 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：03:38 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：03:38 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"警方圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/228746d6819d1c9d49a1b474ca58f901/2026-11/2026-11-26_19_33_44.png\"/><p>警方聯同相關部門，根據線報及深入調查，周四（26日）下午在灣仔區展開代號「虎尾」的掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東及駱克道多個樓上單位。</p><p>行動中，執法人員拘捕10名年齡介乎16至45歲的內地女子，涉嫌違反逗留條件。所有被捕人士現正被扣留調查，稍後交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:04:21.470093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T19:38:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:17:34.578609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T19:57:49.300447+00:00","content_hash":"01161d6a6c0cf9bd6e7d991973e7e70c14253cb830392bb4049ee18386688952","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}